{
 "schema_version": 1,
 "contract": "workspace-git-vectors",
 "decision": "H77",
 "status": "proposed",
 "description": "Vectors for the pure Git-state analysis of whr validate (committed .gitmodules blob and tree/index listings). Owned by T026. A tree or index entry is the string 'MODE SHA PATH'; a SHA of one hex character stands for 40 repetitions of it. 'tree' is the HEAD tree (or the index when head is false), 'index' defaults to 'tree'; 'gitmodules' is the blob text, 'bytes_hex' raw bytes; generate_bytes pads the template to 'total' bytes with newlines; generate_entries adds N submodules projects/sNNN (with their gitlinks when with_gitlinks). expect_codes is the sorted set of distinct finding codes. Messages never echo URL credentials (canary 'CANARY').",
